{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban indoor fireworks, sparklers and pyrotechnics in public venues",
        "additional_details": "We are concerned about the safety for fireworks, sparklers and pyrotechnics in public venues. Indoor pyrotechnics can result in devastating loss of life in public venues. In the last 50 years in Europe, over 550 people have died and more than 1,500 have sustained severe, life-changing burn injuries.",
        "background": "We are concerned with the safety of fireworks, sparklers and pyrotechnics in public venues following recent mass casualty events in Europe. We would like to see tighter regulation and ban on indoor fireworks, sparklers and pyrotechnics.",
